    /// # Errors
    ///
    /// * [`erc721::Error::NonexistentToken`] - If token does not exist and
    ///   `auth` is not [`Address::ZERO`].
    /// * [`erc721::Error::InsufficientApproval`] - If `auth` is not
    ///   [`Address::ZERO`] and `auth` does not have a right to approve this
